          "evidence": "For T={s}, W_T={1,s} and C_T is the interval [-d_s e_s,d_s e_s]. The endpoint faces are the singleton cosets; the finite chamber formula gives trivial stabilizer on the two open rays and W_T at the origin (steps 1.1, 5.1, 7.1)."
        },
        {
