          "source": "lem-cg-spherical-coset-inclusion-and-intersection",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "$wW_T\\cap w'W_{T'}\\neq\\emptyset$ if and only if $w^{-1}w'\\in W_TW_{T'}$, where $W_TW_{T'}=\\{ab:a\\in W_T,\\ b\\in W_{T'}\\}$.",
