          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "A subset $U\\subseteq X$ is declared open if and only if $U\\cap\\iota_p(C_p)$ is relatively open in $\\iota_p(C_p)$ for every nonempty face $p$ ([[def-metric-topology]]).",
