          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "the intersection condition holds because the intersection of two spherical cosets is a spherical coset of type $T\\cap T'$ or empty ([[lem-cg-spherical-coset-inclusion-and-intersection]] (3)), so the images of $C_p$ and $C_q$ meet exactly in the image of the face of $C_{p\\wedge q}$.",
          "uses": [
